# Healing Salve's shield of 3 is on Bot2, whom Basking Rootwalla and Hired Claw (1 power each) attack while Bot1's Valley
# Flamecaller says "If a Lizard ... you control would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals that much damage
# plus 1 instead". As assigned, the 2 damage would all be prevented, but the replacement may make it more, so Bot2 is
# asked which source's damage the shield prevents first (CR 615.7) and chooses Hired Claw's. For each damage event the
# Flamecaller's replacement and the shield both apply, and Bot2 chooses the replacement first each time (CR 616.1): Hired
# Claw's 2 is prevented, then 1 of the Rootwalla's 2, and 1 is dealt. Before that, Hired Claw's attack trigger dealt its 1
# plus 1 to Bot2, before the shield existed (CR 615.4): 20 - 2 - 1 = 17.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Valley Flamecaller
Basking Rootwalla
Hired Claw
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Healing Salve
Island x25

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Valley Flamecaller.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Basking Rootwalla.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hired Claw.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Basking Rootwalla > Bot2; Hired Claw > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
? Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Healing Salve.Cast
Bot2.Modes(Prevent the next 3 damage)
Bot2.Target(Bot2)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Choose(Hired Claw)
Bot2.Replace(Valley Flamecaller)
Bot2.Replace(Valley Flamecaller)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Prevented = 2 Hired Claw > Bot2 by Healing Salve; 1 Basking Rootwalla > Bot2 by Healing Salve
